  "instructions": [
    "Lay a rice paper wrap flat on a clean surface.",
    "Arrange 3 perilla leaves in the center of the wrap, overlapping them slightly.",
    "Place 1.5 ounces of smoked salmon on top of the perilla leaves.",
    "Add 1/8 cup of pickled daikon, 1 tablespoon of chopped fresh dill, and a drizzle of sesame oil on top of the salmon.",
    "Drizzle with lime juice and season with salt to taste.",
    "Fold the bottom half of the wrap up over the filling, then fold in the sides and roll up the wrap tightly.",
    "Repeat with the remaining ingredients and wraps.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
